   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Eight hundred years ago, inside the quiet scriptorium of Sineozersk monastery, monk Konstantin is busy copying an ancient book. His mentor, Father Grigory, watches over him strictly and criticizes his slow and messy handwriting. Konstantin complains that his hand is going numb and that he feels deep dread in his soul. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
